<title>USA: Dawson Production sets $140 mln snr notes.</title>
<headline>Dawson Production sets $140 mln snr notes.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following debt issue from Dawson Production Services Inc was priced on Friday, according to sole manager Jefferies &amp; Co Inc.</p>
<p>BORROWER DAWSON PRODUCTION SERVICES INC</p>
<p>AMT $140 MLN	 COUPON 9.375 PCT  MATURITY 2/1/2007</p>
<p>TYPE SNR NOTES     ISS PRICE 100.00  FIRST PAY DATE 8/1/1997</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S B1    YIELD  9.375 PCT  PAY FREQ  SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P B-PLUS    SPREAD 308 BPS    CALLABLE  NON-CALLL FIVE</p>
<p>U.S. corporate bond unit, 212 859-1678</p>
</text>
